msgid "Services for messaging handles"
msgstr "Servizzi għall-identifikaturi tal-messaġġi"

#: src/postulo/plugins/messaging_services/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Which messaging services a handle can be on — Matrix, XMPP, Signal, Telegram, Threema — and what a handle on each one looks like. A handle on none of them is listed as “Other”. Nothing here is ever looked up online."
msgstr "Fuq liema servizzi tal-messaġġi jista' jkun identifikatur tal-messaġġi — Matrix, XMPP, Signal, Telegram, Threema — u kif jidher identifikatur fuq kull wieħed. Identifikatur li mhu fuq l-ebda wieħed minnhom jitniżżel bħala “Ieħor”. Xejn minn hawn ma jiġi mfittex online."
